From a79170a3b6f7f15e0d0991c4be985b42c4a71b28 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Anders Jensen-Waud <5827908+ajensenwaud@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 23:20:49 +1100
Subject: [PATCH 5/9] server: a JSON tool call max_tokens cuts is the reply's
 cut call (Ripple's <tool_call> JSON form)

tool_stream.cutCalls falls back to tool_json_cut once GLM's cut finds none: an open <tool_call> whose JSON payload
has named an offered tool returns that call with its arguments as far as written (a whole arguments object ends at
its closing brace); a call cut before its name is whole stays text, as GLM's does.
